[2026-10-17 01:31:42] LLM suggestion: ## Analysis

### Pareto Front Assessment

Let me identify the non-dominated experiments (maximizing both Elastic Modulus and Pore Fraction simultaneously):

| Condition | Modulus (bar) | Pore Fraction | Quality Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| 14-0add-8deg (run1) | 103.6 | 0.75 | minor creases |
